# Containers (Linux) execute these files — keep LF everywhere, regardless of host OS.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
# README media. `text=auto` above would already detect these as binary, but the
# cost of being wrong is a silently corrupted asset, so say it explicitly.
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
